# Output this repository's own tooling produces. build.cake packs to artifacts/, writes coverage to
# coverage/ and the InspectCode SARIF to inspection/, and keeps inspectcode's analysis caches in
# .inspectcode-cache/. Cake caches its addins in tools/.
artifacts/
coverage/
inspection/
.inspectcode-cache/
tools/
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/

# Backups a merge tool leaves behind.
*.orig
*.rej

# Operating system clutter.
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# One developer's instructions for an AI coding assistant, and the local working notes for
# ASD-STE100, which derive from a licensed specification. Both are usually symbolic links to one
# copy shared across the organization's repositories, which is why neither entry has a trailing
# slash: git treats a link as a file. See the same entries in SodaFlow's .gitignore for the reasons.
CLAUDE.md
.ste
